{"type":"message","id":"14790489","parentId":"a192604f","timestamp":"2026-03-12T05:33:21.184Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I see. Each skill is a folder with just a SKILL.md file (and optionally scripts, references, assets). Let me look at an example SKILL.md to understand the format.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_yg132615u13x_1","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/usr/lib/node_modules/openclaw/skills/weather/SKILL.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input":88,"output":79,"cacheRead":45125,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":45292,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773293596156}}
{"type":"message","id":"6fcb1b48","parentId":"14790489","timestamp":"2026-03-12T05:33:21.197Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_yg132615u13x_1","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\nname: weather\ndescription: \"Get current weather and forecasts via wttr.in or Open-Meteo. Use when: user asks about weather, temperature, or forecasts for any location. NOT for: historical weather data, severe weather alerts, or detailed meteorological analysis. No API key needed.\"\nhomepage: https://wttr.in/:help\nmetadata: { \"openclaw\": { \"emoji\": \"🌤️\", \"requires\": { \"bins\": [\"curl\"] } } }\n---\n\n# Weather Skill\n\nGet current weather conditions and forecasts.\n\n## When to Use\n\n✅ **USE this skill when:**\n\n- \"What's the weather?\"\n- \"Will it rain today/tomorrow?\"\n- \"Temperature in [city]\"\n- \"Weather forecast for the week\"\n- Travel planning weather checks\n\n## When NOT to Use\n\n❌ **DON'T use this skill when:**\n\n- Historical weather data → use weather archives/APIs\n- Climate analysis or trends → use specialized data sources\n- Hyper-local microclimate data → use local sensors\n- Severe weather alerts → check official NWS sources\n- Aviation/marine weather → use specialized services (METAR, etc.)\n\n## Location\n\nAlways include a city, region, or airport code in weather queries.\n\n## Commands\n\n### Current Weather\n\n```bash\n# One-line summary\ncurl \"wttr.in/London?format=3\"\n\n# Detailed current conditions\ncurl \"wttr.in/London?0\"\n\n# Specific city\ncurl \"wttr.in/New+York?format=3\"\n```\n\n### Forecasts\n\n```bash\n# 3-day forecast\ncurl \"wttr.in/London\"\n\n# Week forecast\ncurl \"wttr.in/London?format=v2\"\n\n# Specific day (0=today, 1=tomorrow, 2=day after)\ncurl \"wttr.in/London?1\"\n```\n\n### Format Options\n\n```bash\n# One-liner\ncurl \"wttr.in/London?format=%l:+%c+%t+%w\"\n\n# JSON output\ncurl \"wttr.in/London?format=j1\"\n\n# PNG image\ncurl \"wttr.in/London.png\"\n```\n\n### Format Codes\n\n- `%c` — Weather condition emoji\n- `%t` — Temperature\n- `%f` — \"Feels like\"\n- `%w` — Wind\n- `%h` — Humidity\n- `%p` — Precipitation\n- `%l` — Location\n\n## Quick Responses\n\n**\"What's the weather?\"**\n\n```bash\ncurl -s \"wttr.in/London?format=%l:+%c+%t+(feels+like+%f),+%w+wind,+%h+humidity\"\n```\n\n**\"Will it rain?\"**\n\n```bash\ncurl -s \"wttr.in/London?format=%l:+%c+%p\"\n```\n\n**\"Weekend forecast\"**\n\n```bash\ncurl \"wttr.in/London?format=v2\"\n```\n\n## Notes\n\n- No API key needed (uses wttr.in)\n- Rate limited; don't spam requests\n- Works for most global cities\n- Supports airport codes: `curl wttr.in/ORD`\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1773293601189}}
{"type":"message","id":"44d73114","parentId":"6fcb1b48","timestamp":"2026-03-12T05:33:28.436Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I understand the skill format. I need to create a hotel-competitor skill in the workspace. Let me create the skill directory and SKILL.md file.Based on the GitHub repo, this skill is for hotel competitor analysis. I'll create it with a proper SKILL.md that describes the skill and how to use it.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"现在我来创建这个 skill。首先创建 skill 目录和 SKILL.md：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_iov78hy3cj09_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"mkdir -p /home/gem/workspace/agent/workspace/hotel-competitor/scripts"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input":831,"output":126,"cacheRead":45125,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":46082,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773293601196}}
